# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# SIIQO PLATFORM — SECURITY CONFIGURATION
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values.
# NEVER commit .env to git — it contains secrets!
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ADMIN IP WHITELIST
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Comma-separated list of IP addresses or CIDR ranges allowed to access admin panel.
# Examples:
#   - Single IP: 102.91.132.249
#   - Multiple IPs: 102.91.132.249,105.112.45.67
#   - CIDR range: 102.91.132.0/24
#   - Development (allow all): * 
#
# PRODUCTION: Always restrict to known admin IPs!
# If empty and FLASK_ENV=production, admin panel will be BLOCKED.
#
ADMIN_IP_WHITELIST=102.91.132.0/24,105.112.0.0/16

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RATE LIMITING — REDIS STORAGE
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Redis URL for distributed rate limiting across multiple servers.
# Format: redis://host:port/db or rediss://host:port/db (SSL)
#
# Production: Use AWS ElastiCache, Redis Cloud, or self-hosted Redis
# Development: Leave empty to use in-memory storage (not distributed)
#
# REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
# REDIS_URL=redis://your-elasticache-endpoint.aws.com:6379/0
REDIS_URL=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FLASK ENVIRONMENT
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Options: development, production, testing
# In production: enables HSTS, stricter CSP, requires admin IP whitelist
#
FLASK_ENV=production

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DATABASE
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/siiqo_db

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# JWT SECRET (CRITICAL!)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generate with: python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(32))"
# NEVER use the example value in production!
#
JWT_SECRET_KEY=your-super-secret-jwt-key-change-this-in-production

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# EMAIL (SMTP)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AWS SES, Gmail, SendGrid, or any SMTP provider
# Port 587 = TLS, Port 465 = SSL
#
MAIL_SERVER=email-smtp.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
MAIL_PORT=587
MAIL_USERNAME=your-ses-username
MAIL_PASSWORD=your-ses-password
MAIL_DEFAULT_SENDER=noreply@siiqo.com

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PAYSCROW (Escrow Payment Gateway)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PAYSCROW_API_KEY=your-payscrow-api-key
PAYSCROW_ENV=production  # or sandbox
PAYSCROW_BASE_URL=https://api.payscrow.net

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AWS S3 (File Storage)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your-aws-access-key
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your-aws-secret-key
AWS_REGION=us-east-1
S3_BUCKET_NAME=siiqo-uploads

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CORS — ALLOWED ORIGINS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Comma-separated list of allowed frontend domains
# Production: Only list your actual frontend domains!
#
CORS_ORIGINS=https://siiqo.com,https://www.siiqo.com,https://admin.siiqo.com

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECURITY MONITORING (Optional but Recommended)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sentry for error tracking and security alerting
# SENTRY_DSN=https://your-sentry-dsn@sentry.io/project-id

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ADDITIONAL SECURITY SETTINGS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Disable background scheduler if running on multiple servers (only run on one)
# DISABLE_SCHEDULER=false

# Secret key for request signing (generate same way as JWT_SECRET_KEY)
# REQUEST_SIGNING_SECRET=your-request-signing-secret-key
